{"title": "Moonshield (Condition)", "pageid": 14427, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Moonshield</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Protected by the light of a <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a>. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a> does not affect this entity. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SCL_SAFE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SAFE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SAFE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: do not apply\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 10\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Identical in effect to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Moonshield\">Sources of Moonshield</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SCL_SAFE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Moonshield\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Moonshield</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Protected by the light of a <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a>. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a> does not affect this entity.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Pixie_Blessing\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a> cannot affect this creature thanks to a pixie's protective magic.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Shadow_Curse\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Without a light source, you will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage every turn. This damage <b>doubles</b> each turn the party members are affected by the Shadow Curse.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202021\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplic